    </Folder>
    <Folder><name>基点辐射机会（优先级）</name>
      <Placemark><name>Tauranga / Mount Maunganui｜奥克兰东南扩展</name><styleUrl>#opportunity</styleUrl><description><![CDATA[海岸、海滩、轻徒步、毛利文化与丰盛湾周末小团]]></description><Point><coordinates>176.17,-37.64,0</coordinates></Point></Placemark>
      <Placemark><name>Bay of Islands / Cape Reinga｜奥克兰北延</name><styleUrl>#opportunity</styleUrl><description><![CDATA[二期2—3日线路：海豚、岛屿、毛利文化、九十英里海滩]]></description><Point><coordinates>174.08,-35.25,0</coordinates></Point></Placemark>
      <Placemark><name>Arrowtown / Lake Hayes｜皇后镇近郊</name><styleUrl>#opportunity</styleUrl><description><![CDATA[轻徒步、骑行、湖畔与秋色；亲子、银发和低强度客群]]></description><Point><coordinates>168.83,-44.94,0</coordinates></Point></Placemark>
      <Placemark><name>Te Anau｜皇后镇—米佛承接节点</name><styleUrl>#opportunity</styleUrl><description><![CDATA[萤火虫洞、湖区、前置住宿与轻徒步；适合皇后镇—米佛2日游]]></description><Point><coordinates>167.72,-45.42,0</coordinates></Point></Placemark>
      <Placemark><name>Wanaka / Rob Roy｜徒步升级</name><styleUrl>#opportunity</styleUrl><description><![CDATA[从轻徒步到高山深度体验的难度分层，深化皇后镇南岛户外辐射带]]></description><Point><coordinates>169.22,-44.65,0</coordinates></Point></Placemark>
      <Placemark><name>Aoraki / Tekapo｜南岛多日联动</name><styleUrl>#opportunity</styleUrl><description><![CDATA[库克山冰川与蒂卡波观星，适合2—4日联动，不宜包装成轻松一日游]]></description><Point><coordinates>170.2,-43.85,0</coordinates></Point></Placemark>
    </Folder>
